   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">You can fix this using quo()<div><br></div><div><div>library(dplyr)</div><div>vars &lt;- c(&quot;mpg&quot;, &quot;drat&quot;)</div><div>mtcars %&gt;% group_by(vs) %&gt;% summarize_at(vars, weighted.mean, w = wt)     # Does NOT work</div><div><div>mtcars %&gt;% group_by(vs) %&gt;% summarize_at(vars, weighted.mean, w = ~ wt)     # Does NOT work</div><div>mtcars %&gt;% group_by(vs) %&gt;% summarize_at(vars, weighted.mean, w = .$wt)     # Does NOT work</div></div><div><br></div><div>mtcars %&gt;% group_by(vs) %&gt;% summarize_at(vars, weighted.mean, w = quo(wt))     # DOES work</div></div><div><br></div><div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>On Tuesday, February 20, 2018 at 3:55:43 PM UTC-7, Brandon Hurr wrote:</div></div>"
